+
+Optical in-display Goodix sensor of the OnePlus 8 Pro (G5, TA gfp9608),
+match-on-chip through the Oplus/Goodix trusted application in QSEE.
+The protocol (64-byte request header, payload with target/command,
+Gatekeeper-signed enrollment tokens, keymaster-wrapped HMAC key) was
+recovered from the Android HAL. The finger is detected on the
+touchscreen, and the sensor is lit with a white disk on the framebuffer.
+See libfprint/drivers/goodixoplus/README.md for details and limits.
